2026-07-27T09:41:45.6204165Z i /tmp/Rtmp54KipX/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:41:45.6204476Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:41:45.6204839Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:41:45.6205161Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:41:45.6205651Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:41:45.6206335Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:41:45.6207212Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
